{
  "_comment": "Install-time default brand for this deployment. Copy to brand.json (same folder as the built app) and edit to white-label a dedicated/on-prem box WITHOUT rebuilding. It sets the look before anyone signs in (sign-in screen, page title, theme colour) and is the fallback when a signed-in organization has no brand of its own. On a hosted, multi-tenant deployment leave brand.json absent: each organization's own brand (set by GeoEstate at org setup) is applied after sign-in. Any field may be omitted.",
